# WAIT：EnterKey 形态的一次等待。一条提交（空文本回车）即推进；
# 该形态不写 RESULT/RESULTS（doInputToEmueraProgram 的 switch 里没有 EnterKey 分支）。
case: wait_enter
target: REPLAY_WAIT_ENTER
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameProc.Function/FunctionIdentifier.cs:762-784
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:876-895
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:1119-1287
--- inputs
submit
--- expect-console
START-WAIT-ENTER
AFTER-WAIT
END-WAIT-ENTER
